{"id":"vod_md_7036","vodId":"7036","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"赤发白雪姬第一季","name_cn":"赤发白雪姬第一季","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231229-1/1b31256f3f247245f6db5e560d3ce753.jpg"},"summary":"个性活泼开朗的白雪（早见沙织 配音）拥有一头美丽炫目的红发，从小生活在深山之中，令白雪拥有着超越常人的敏锐和活力。让白雪没有想到的是，自己竟然即将被迫嫁给好色而又愚笨的拉冀王子（福山润 配音）为妾，桀骜不驯的白雪发誓绝不向命运屈服。在留下了一束红发之后，白雪离开了家乡在前往邻国的途中，白雪邂逅了克拉利涅斯王国的二皇子千（逢坂良太 配音），跟随着千的，是忠心耿耿的两位侍从木木（名冢佳织 配音）和光秀（梅原裕一郎 配音）。在得知了千的真实身份之后，白雪决定放弃自己的一切，追随千来到他的王国，辅佐千，成为他的左膀右臂。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-12-29 00:38:46","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231227/Hj53IL3X/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231227/uoMIuLxd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231227/eM733yOY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231227/HFBtRvQA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231227/7XfVzvh3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231227/RWnsaZpr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231227/tyh5Dbli/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231227/JQHgRNev/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231227/xneMHcO6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231227/ywwLysLN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231227/heO2w5ZW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231227/Eq9HUJxv/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:35.787Z"}